# Lentils and Sausage Instant Pot Soup

Adapted for an Instant Pot from [https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/…](https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/45426/lentil-and-sausage-soup) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250530005444/https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/45426/lentil-and-sausage-soup))

{ rating="4" image="lentils_and_sausage_instant_pot_soup.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1/2 lb [sweet Italian pork sausage]{ ing="sweet-italian-pork-sausage" }, sliced
- [ ] 1 large [onion]{ ing="onion" }, chopped
- [ ] 2 stalk [celery]{ ing="celery" }, finely chopped (optional)
- [ ] 1 cup [carrot]{ ing="carrot" }, coined
- [ ] 3 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 8 cups [water and/or broth]{ ing="water-and-or-broth" }
- [ ] 1 (28 ounce) can [diced tomatoes]{ ing="diced-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 1 (16 ounce) package [dry lentils]{ ing="dry-lentils" }, rinsed
- [ ] 1 tsp [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [dried basil]{ ing="dried-basil" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [dried oregano]{ ing="dried-oregano" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [dried parsley]{ ing="dried-parsley" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [dried thyme]{ ing="dried-thyme" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [garlic powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 2 large [bay leaves]{ ing="bay-leaves" }
- [ ] 1 cup [pasta such as ditalini]{ ing="pasta-such-as-ditalini" }

## Recipe

1. Prep the spices and vegetables
1. Saute the [sausage]{ ing="sweet-italian-pork-sausage" } in an Instant Pot until browned
1. Add the diced [onion]{ ing="onion" }, [celery]{ ing="celery" }, [carrot]{ ing="carrot" }, and minced [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }. Saute until tender and translucent (5 min).
1. Pour in the water, [broth]{ ing="water-and-or-broth" }, [diced tomatoes]{ ing="diced-tomatoes" }, [lentils]{ ing="dry-lentils" }, and spices.
1. Cook on high pressure for 15 min, then quick release
1. Set the Instant Pot to saute for 15 min and add the pasta

## Notes

- Brown/green lentils (12-15 min pressure) hold shape well and add peppery flavor; red lentils (8 min pressure) cook faster but create mushy texture with nutty flavor
- Optional: Finish with olive oil drizzle and lemon juice
- Can omit pasta for lower-carb version or substitute with greens added at the end
